==Strategy==
The main problem of this stage are the two Teacher Bears, as when they come out they will hang out behind The Face, tearing into your units. A Long Distance attacker can easily fix this issue, or you could use the default Cat Cannon to knock back and eventually defeat the Teacher Bears, although this only really works well in Delivery 1-3, when the Teacher Bears have less HP. Other than that, make sure to bring along something that can outrange The Face, like Crazed Bahamut Cat, as he can safely hit The Face from a distance, making the stage a whole lot quicker.

